  "question": {
    "text": "The values of electronegativity of atom <math><mtext>A</mtext></math> and <math><mtext>B</mtext></math> are 1.20 and 4.0 respectively. The percentage of ionic character of <math><mtext>A</mtext><mo>-</mo><mtext>B</mtext></math> bond is nearly",
